# Portfolio - Interactive 3D Portfolio

An interactive 3D portfolio showcasing cutting-edge web development with Three.js and React Three Fiber.

## Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 15.3.3 with TypeScript
- **3D Graphics**: Three.js, React Three Fiber, React Three Drei
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4
- **Fonts**: Geist Sans & Mono
- **Deployment**: Vercel

## Project Structure

### Source Files (`/src`)

#### `/src/app`
- **globals.css** - Global styles and Tailwind CSS configuration
- **layout.tsx** - Root layout component with metadata and font configuration
- **page.tsx** - Main portfolio page component with experiences and projects

#### `/src/components`
- **Brain3D.tsx** - Interactive 3D brain model component with lightning effects
- **ExperienceCard.tsx** - Reusable card component for displaying work experiences
- **ProjectCard.tsx** - Reusable card component for displaying projects

#### `/src/lib`
- **colorMap.ts** - Color mapping utility for consistent styling across components

